---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
import Card from "../components/ui/Card.astro";
import Kicker from "../components/ui/Kicker.astro";

const listingTitle = 'Never Sleep: Keep Screen On';
const shortDescription = 'Keep your screen on with one tap.';
const fullDescription = `Keep your screen on with one tap.

Never sleep. Always awake.

Never Sleep changes your screen timeout with one tap. Your screen stays awake while you read, follow a recipe, check a reference, or use another app. Turn it off when you are done to restore your previous timeout.

YOUR CHOICE OF CONTROLS
One-tap toggle in the app
Quick Settings tile for access from the notification shade
Compact 1×1 home-screen widget
Works after you leave the app

YOU STAY IN CONTROL
Never Sleep uses Android’s “Modify system settings” permission to change the screen-off timeout. The app explains why it needs access before opening Android Settings. You can revoke access at any time.

Turn Never Sleep off before uninstalling, clearing its storage, or revoking permission so it can restore your previous timeout. Device security policies and manufacturer settings may limit how long the screen stays on. Keeping the display awake uses more battery.

OPTIONAL ADS
Banner ads support development. You can turn them off in Settings at no charge. Privacy choices are available where required. No account or subscription is needed.

Android 7 or later.
Developer: Lizz Studio
Support: home@lizz.com
Privacy policy: https://neversleep.app/privacy`;
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Google Play Listing — Never Sleep"
    description="Store listing copy, assets checklist, and Play Console URLs for Never Sleep."
>
    <article class="doc">
        <Kicker>Google Play</Kicker>
        <h1>Play Store listing</h1>
        <p class="lede">
            Copy-paste fields for Play Console. Live site:
            <code>https://neversleep.app</code>
        </p>
        <div class="actions doc-actions">
            <Button href="/">Home</Button>
            <Button href="/privacy" variant="secondary">Privacy policy</Button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Local dev only — this page is not deployed to neversleep.app.</p>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>Store URLs</h2>
            <dl class="listing-meta">
                <div>
                    <dt>Privacy policy URL</dt>
                    <dd><a href="/privacy">https://neversleep.app/privacy</a></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Application ID</dt>
                    <dd><code>com.lizz.neversleep</code></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Developer</dt>
                    <dd>Lizz Studio</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Support email</dt>
                    <dd><a href="mailto:home@lizz.com">home@lizz.com</a></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Category</dt>
                    <dd>Tools</dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>App title</h2>
            <p class="copy-block">{listingTitle}</p>
            <h2>Short description</h2>
            <p class="copy-block">{shortDescription}</p>
            <p class="hint">{shortDescription.length} / 80 characters max</p>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>Full description</h2>
            <pre class="copy-block">{fullDescription}</pre>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>Graphics checklist</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>App icon — <code>assets/play-store/icon-512.png</code> (512×512)</li>
                <li>Phone screenshots — <code>assets/play-store/screenshots/</code></li>
                <li>Feature graphic — <code>assets/play-store/feature-graphic.png</code> (1024×500)</li>
            </ul>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>Hosting</h2>
            <p class="copy-block">
                Locally built GitHub Pages site at
                <code>neversleep.app</code>
            </p>
            <p class="hint">
                Local asset preview: open <code>assets/play-store/preview.html</code> in a browser.
            </p>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>AdMob</h2>
            <dl class="listing-meta">
                <div>
                    <dt>App ID</dt>
                    <dd><code>ca-app-pub-5214975738753935~5698552370</code></dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <dt>Banner unit</dt>
                    <dd><code>ca-app-pub-5214975738753935/4818761149</code></dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
        </Card>

        <Card class="listing-card">
            <h2>Data safety (summary)</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>No account registration</li>
                <li>
                    Approximate location: IP address may be used by AdMob to estimate general location
                </li>
                <li>App activity: ad interactions may be collected and shared by AdMob</li>
                <li>App info and performance: diagnostics may be collected and shared by AdMob</li>
                <li>Device or other identifiers: may be collected and shared by AdMob</li>
                <li>Purposes: advertising, analytics, and fraud prevention</li>
                <li>Data encrypted in transit (AdMob SDK)</li>
                <li>Users can disable ads and revisit applicable privacy choices in-app</li>
                <li>App preferences excluded from cloud backup and device transfer</li>
                <li>Contains ads: Yes. Advertising ID: Yes</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="hint">
                Verify the live Play Console form against Google Mobile Ads SDK data-disclosure guidance
                before every release.
            </p>
        </Card>
    </article>
</SiteLayout>
